{"id":"6e51cbfe-9394-571a-aa5a-5ff2fa96610e","title":"技能与工作流程","icon":"🧠","cover":"none","parentId":"79fa3b16-d74e-58cd-81a0-2c01bd8a9499","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"技能与工作流程","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"随 ShowAI 插件分发","title":"说出目标，Agent 选对流程","lead":"ShowAI 插件带有 8 个技能，告诉 Agent 怎样连接、规划、设计、制作、评审页面，怎样做模板和组件，以及怎样和正在编辑的人协作。你只需要说出要什么，Agent 会自己选择技能。","facts":[{"label":"技能","value":"8 个"},{"label":"完整作品阶段","value":"6 个"},{"label":"原生 Page 模板","value":"6 类"}],"actions":[{"label":"安装插件","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/agent-hosts","primary":true},{"label":"组件与模板","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/components"}],"art":"agent"},"integrity":"sha256-7c2bbe84b00357b5e96de32cad51cf6537d38c28d4eadca35435483ba772646e"},"id":"node-87e15ab8"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"技能是写给 Agent 的工作说明，随插件分发；真正的存储、组件编译和渲染由 ShowAI 运行时完成。Agent 的所有文档操作都通过 MCP 进行，CLI 只用于启动、诊断和脚本。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-88e15c4b"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-89e15dde"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"八个技能"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"四个技能负责把一份作品从想法做到交付，另外四个负责连接内容库、沉淀可复用的资源，以及与人同时编辑画布。"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8ae15f71"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":3,"id":"node-8be16104"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"做一份作品"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":2,"cards":[{"icon":"🧭","title":"plan-presentation","tag":"规划","tone":"teal","body":"梳理读者意图、证据需求和多级理解路径。产出任务简报、证据范围和通过条件。"},{"icon":"🎨","title":"design-presentation","tag":"设计","tone":"violet","body":"把规划变成视觉与交互：对象、关系、布局和状态。产出设计稿和资源选择。"},{"icon":"📄","title":"show-document","tag":"制作","tone":"brand","body":"制作、续改、展示和导出报告、讲解