t、library_search、page_read 找到内容后回答，不改动页面。"},{"id":"show","label":"show-document","kind":"skill","position":{"x":230,"y":390},"subtitle":"制作、续改、展示、导出","detail":"完整作品（包括只给一个题目）由它组织规划、设计、制作和评审各阶段。"},{"id":"review","label":"review-presentation","kind":"skill","position":{"x":460,"y":390},"subtitle":"“这里看不懂”","detail":"先读取完整原作品，定位事实、概念、主线、图形或交互上的问题，再连贯修改。"},{"id":"tpl","label":"create-template","kind":"skill","position":{"x":690,"y":390},"subtitle":"做成可复用模板"},{"id":"comp","label":"create-component","kind":"skill","position":{"x":0,"y":540},"subtitle":"现有组件表达不了","detail":"先尝试调整数据或组合已有组件；确有缺口才开发新组件。"},{"id":"page","label":"保存并展示的 Page","kind":"result","position":{"x":345,"y":690},"subtitle":"page_present","detail":"正式内容先保存到项目，再调用 page_present 在对话中展示。"}],"edges":[{"id":"req-use","source":"req","target":"use"},{"id":"use-kind","source":"use","target":"kind"},{"id":"kind-read","source":"kind","target":"read","label":"只是问问"},{"id":"kind-show","source":"kind","target":"show","label":"要成品"},{"id":"kind-review","source":"kind","target":"review","label":"评审"},{"id":"kind-tpl","source":"kind","target":"tpl","label":"建模板"},{"id":"show-comp","source":"show","target":"comp","label":"缺少表达"},{"id":"show-page","source":"show","target":"page"},{"id":"review-page","source":"review","target":"page"},{"id":"tpl-page","source":"tpl","target":"page","label":"真实应用验证"},{"id":"comp-page","source":"comp","target":"page","label":"放入真实页面"}]},{"id":"stages","label":"完整作品的六个阶段","description":"show-document 依次推进这些阶段；每个阶段在进入时才读取当前模板的指南。","direction":"TB","nodes":[{"id":"intent","label":"intent","kind":"query","position":{"x":0,"y":0},"subtitle":"意图理解","detail":"明确读者是谁、要完成什么任务，区分明确要求、合理假设和未知条件。"},{"id":"evidence","label":"evidence","kind":"query","position":{"x":0,"y":125},"subtitle":"材料处理","detail":"收集和核对所需事实；模板目录和基础说明不能代替真实研究。"},{"id":"understanding","label":"understanding","kind":"skill","position":{"x":0,"y":250},"subtitle":"理解路径 · plan-presentation","detail":"从读者起点展开多级理解树，叶子包含定义、关系、过程、例子或条件。复杂作品在制作前